      "text": "1 to 3\n\n---\nRequirements Sotroz is within 30 feet of a bonded cage that has a living small or tiny animal inside of it\n\n---\nEffect Sotroz steals the life-force of the trapped animal, killing it instantly and gaining one of the following abilities depending on the number of actions spent.\n- Gate Jump 1 Sotroz teleports to a space within any ritual circle in their sanctum.\n- Transmute Death 2 Sotroz casts Vision of Death on a living target within 60 feet of their current location.\n- Life Steal 3 Sotroz casts a 4th-rank Vampiric Feast on a living target within 30 feet of their current location."
